    <p class="about-lead">Getting dressed is a daily act of intention. Styley exists to make it feel that way.</p>

    <p class="about-text">We believe everyone has a fashion north star — an instinct for how clothes make you feel, and how you need to feel to own the day. Styley helps you find yours: your closet distilled into feelings and purpose, with an editorial eye when you need one.</p>

